{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz8gh3n06e4rodpl8l2syek","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmsz8gh3n06e4rodpl8l2syek","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz8gh3n06e4rodpl8l2syek","published_at":"2026-08-18T22:27:16.191000Z","ref":"A1","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","summary":"Anthropic 公布两项实验：Claude（Mythos Preview 和 Opus 4.8）针对 15 个靶点设计蛋白质结合剂，成功 14 个，命中率达 22.6%-35.1%。","title":"Claude 如何加速蛋白质设计与分析化学研究","title_en":"How Claude is accelerating protein design and analytical chemistry","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/Claude-accelerates-protein-design"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz79zol04j8rodpvun6zobl","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmsz79zol04j8rodpvun6zobl","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz79zol04j8rodpvun6zobl","published_at":"2026-08-18T21:26:01.095000Z","ref":"A2","score":74,"selected":true,"source":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","summary":"Mojo🔥 语言现已正式开源，采用 Apache 2.0 许可证（含 LLVM 例外），编译器、工具链及全部源码已发布至 modular GitHub 仓库。Mojo 上周刚达成 1.0 版本（源码稳定），此次开源涵盖整个编译器与工具链。目前暂不接受编译器相关贡献，计划年底前开放，标准库自 2024 年起已接受社区贡献。","title":"Mojo 语言正式开源，编译器与工具链全面开放","title_en":"Mojo 现已开源！","url":"https://www.modular.com/blog/mojo-open-source"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz49ptt022qrodp5mc1nt1x","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmsz49ptt022qrodp5mc1nt1x","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz49ptt022qrodp5mc1nt1x","published_at":"2026-08-18T20:06:01Z","ref":"A3","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"X：Claude (@claudeai)","summary":"Claude 现在可以在 Gmail 中发送邮件，并管理 Google Drive 中的文件。\n\n让 Claude 回复某个邮件线程，它会起草并发送回复。你可以控制何时需要你的批准。\n\n从连接器菜单中选择连接 Gmail 或 Google Drive 即可试用。所有付费套餐均可用。","title":"Claude 现已支持 Gmail 邮件与 Google Drive 文件管理","title_en":"Claude can now send emails in Gmail and manage files in Google Drive. Ask Claude to reply to a thre…","url":"https://x.com/claudeai/status/2089806039088517356"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz1zjiy013pro3f1e0aafra","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmsz1zjiy013pro3f1e0aafra","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz1zjiy013pro3f1e0aafra","published_at":"2026-08-18T19:26:08.389000Z","ref":"A4","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"Claude：Blog（网页）","summary":"Anthropic 的 CI 工程师用 Claude Tag 构建了值班智能体，作为 CI/CD 故障的一线响应者。Claude 在事故发生后中位 14 分钟发布首份基于证据的分析，最快案例中 3 分钟内验证修复并确认错误率恢复基线。该方案通过 Slack 频道、Datadog 或 Grafana 工具访问及 GitHub 技能文件实现，Anthropic 已发布通用设置套件供其他团队部署。","title":"Claude Tag 如何担任 Anthropic CI/CD 故障的一线响应者","title_en":"Claude on call： How Claude Tag serves as Anthropic's first responder for CI/CD failures","url":"https://claude.com/blog/ai-ci-cd-on-call"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz1974l06hbro20gosn5d78","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmsz1974l06hbro20gosn5d78","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz1974l06hbro20gosn5d78","published_at":"2026-08-18T18:09:38Z","ref":"A5","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"Hugging Face：Blog（RSS）","summary":"智能体记忆并非可随意开启的功能，而是需按模型能力校准的剂量。强模型适合注入完整指南集，DeepSeek-V3.2（671B MoE）任务完成率提升+9.5个百分点；较弱模型采用精选检索效果最佳，gpt-oss-120b（117B MoE）提升+16.1pp且仅增加+5% token。该方法无需更新权重或人工标注，通过从智能体过往轨迹中蒸馏指南并在推理时注入实现。","title":"智能体记忆并非越多越好：八款模型评测显示剂量需按能力校准","title_en":"How Much Memory Does Your Agent Actually Need？","url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/altk-evolve-hmm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz0hbsg05l0ro204080cotv","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmsz0hbsg05l0ro204080cotv","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsz0hbsg05l0ro204080cotv","published_at":"2026-08-18T11:00:00Z","ref":"A6","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","summary":"OpenAI 因 OpenAI-Hugging Face 事件及即将推出的 Astra 模型可能达到《预备框架》下的\"关键网络安全能力\"阈值，暂时放缓了模型扩展速度，包括暂停最新部署模型的强化学习训练两周，并搁置最大规模前沿 RL 运行。公司已加强研究环境安全，要求对 Astra 及网络相关负载实施最严格防护，并扩展思维链监控，采用多阶段激活分类器检测机制。","title":"OpenAI 在\"关键网络能力\"时代放缓模型开发节奏","title_en":"Pacing model development in an era of cyber-critical capabilities","url":"https://openai.com/index/pacing-model-development-cyber-capabilities"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsykcnkt0yh1roz0a9h404r5","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmsykcnkt0yh1roz0a9h404r5","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsykcnkt0yh1roz0a9h404r5","published_at":"2026-08-18T11:00:00Z","ref":"A7","score":60,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","summary":"OpenAI 发布 ChatGPT for Teens，为 13-17 岁用户自动启用，内置更强安全保护与家长控制。新增 Study Mode、负责任作业提醒、测验与学习可视化，以及可设定默认开启时段的 Study Hours，引导青少年分步解题而非直接给答案。OpenAI 同时宣布与 CodeAI 合作，帮助青少年理解、质疑并创造性地使用 AI。","title":"OpenAI 推出 ChatGPT for Teens：面向青少年的学习体验与更强安全保护","title_en":"Introducing ChatGPT for Teens： Built for learning， backed by protections","url":"https://openai.com/index/chatgpt-for-teens"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsycmgww0rkrroz0nfma0z05","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmsycmgww0rkrroz0nfma0z05","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsycmgww0rkrroz0nfma0z05","published_at":"2026-08-18T07:00:00Z","ref":"A8","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"Google AI：DEV 作者专属（RSS）","summary":"本文演示如何用开源评测框架 Inspect AI 和 Harbor 评估 agent 技能，并借助 Google Sheets 和 Data Studio 进行可视化分析。","title":"设计 AI 评测：先求清晰，再谈可视化","title_en":"Designing AI Evals： Clarity Now and Visualization Next","url":"https://dev.to/googleai/designing-ai-evals-clarity-now-and-visualization-next-4eii"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsyqip4o14umroz0ch5iv0iv","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmsyqip4o14umroz0ch5iv0iv","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsyqip4o14umroz0ch5iv0iv","published_at":"2026-08-18T00:00:00Z","ref":"A9","score":75,"selected":true,"source":"Hugging Face：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Sentence Transformers v6.0 新增第四种模型类型 MultiVectorEncoder，可直接加载 PyLate、Stanford-NLP ColBERT 及 colpali-engine 检查点，用于 ColBERT 式晚期交互检索。","title":"Sentence Transformers v6.0 新增 MultiVectorEncoder，支持 ColBERT 风格多向量模型","title_en":"Multi-Vector （Late Interaction） Embedding Models with Sentence Transformers","url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/multi-vector-encoder"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsxwd7a40coxroz06g25sfaf","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmsxwd7a40coxroz06g25sfaf","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsxwd7a40coxroz06g25sfaf","published_at":"2026-08-17T23:58:00Z","ref":"A10","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"作者基于Reddit上\"让Claude真正开始思考\"的帖子，引入逻辑学中的\"钢人论证\"（steelman）概念，并自创了一个\"双向钢人Prompt\"。该Prompt通过重述真实问题、强化正反双方观点、找出关键变量、逼AI给出明确判断四步，旨在避免模型谄媚，帮助用户找到问题最本质的答案。作者以自己选择公司司庆日的真实案例演示了使用效果。","title":"一个实用的深度思考Prompt：用\"双向钢人论证\"让AI帮你挖出最本质的答案","title_en":"一个极度实用的深度思考Prompt，帮你挖出最本质的答案。","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647685329&idx=1&sn=9471278dc489641c097b228912965ed4"}],"counts":{"aihot_published":10,"aihot_upstream":10,"trendradar_matched":19,"trendradar_published":19,"trendradar_raw":327},"generated_at":"2026-08-19T07:40:29+08:00","report_date":"2026-08-19","run_id":"20260819T074029+0800","schema_version":1,"source_status":{"aihot":{"api_version":"1.7.0","page_count":1,"status":"live"},"trendradar":{"platform_count":11,"snapshot_count":3,"status":"live"}},"timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","trendradar_items":[{"crawl_count":3,"first_crawl_time":"2026-08-19T00:57:46+08:00","id":"d53b5e6fbaa3fc633ed144db","last_crawl_time":"2026-08-19T07:39:46+08:00","platform":"华尔街见闻","platform_id":"wallstreetcn-hot","rank":1,"rank_change":0,"ref":"N1","title":"AI债务化担忧发酵，美股指三连跌，芯片指数重挫5%，美长债走V","url":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3779677"},{"crawl_count":3,"first_crawl_time":"2026-08-19T00:57:46+08:00","id":"0924e9da9e67daf67a22f660","last_crawl_time":"2026-08-19T07:39:46+08:00","platform":"华尔街见闻","platform_id":"wallstreetcn-hot","rank":5